{
  "info": {
    "name": "Campus Connect",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "8d30f395-a8a0-4b5f-a33d-27fbb403ec16",
    "description": "Campus Connect ↔ Jazeera University integration API.\n\nEvery request is signed by the collection pre-request script using the `partnerCode` and `apiKey` environment variables. Dean and student flows additionally use separate role tokens — `deanToken` and `studentToken` — set by the login requests in folder 02. See campus-connect/README.md for the full reference."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost/campus-connect"
    },
    {
      "key": "partnerCode",
      "value": "campus_connect"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "<replace-with-your-api-key>"
    },
    {
      "key": "deanToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "studentToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "partnerAuth",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "timestamp",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "exec": [
          "// Campus Connect partner signature (computed per request)",
          "const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
          "pm.variables.set(\"timestamp\", ts);",
          "",
          "const sig = CryptoJS.SHA512(pm.variables.get(\"apiKey\") + ts).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "pm.variables.set(\"partnerAuth\", btoa(pm.variables.get(\"partnerCode\") + \":\" + sig));"
        ],
        "type": "text/javascript"
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 · Setup & Partner Auth",
      "description": "Verifies the partner API key is signed correctly.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ping — verify partner credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{partnerAuth}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Timestamp",
                "value": "{{timestamp}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/ping",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "ping"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "description": "Connectivity check. Requires a valid partner signature; the pre-request script computes it automatically from partnerCode + apiKey."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Login (role tokens)",
      "description": "Exchange credentials for a role token (X-Access-Token). The dean token is stored in `deanToken`, the student token in `studentToken` — each reused by its respective folder below.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dean login (staff_user)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{partnerAuth}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Timestamp",
                "value": "{{timestamp}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/dean/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "dean",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"<dean-username>\",\n  \"password\": \"<dean-password>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "description": "Authenticates a dean from the admin dashboard (staff_user). Returns a JWT signed with the partner secret and the list of faculties this dean may access (config + emp_user_faculties).",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"deanToken\", json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.test(\"Login stored deanToken\", () => pm.collectionVariables.get(\"deanToken\").length > 0);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Login succeeded\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.resultCode).to.eql('0');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Student login (online_student_login)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{partnerAuth}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Timestamp",
                "value": "{{timestamp}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/student/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "student",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"<StudentID>\",\n  \"password\": \"<student-password>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "description": "Authenticates a student using the student portal credentials. Only active (enrolled) students of an allowed faculty (economics, facultyId 12) may log in. Returns a JWT signed with the partner secret.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"studentToken\", json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.test(\"Login stored studentToken\", () => pm.collectionVariables.get(\"studentToken\").length > 0);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Login succeeded\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.resultCode).to.eql('0');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Dean · Faculty Overview",
      "description": "Faculty-scoped reads. Requires a dean X-Access-Token (folder 02 — run the Dean login request first; it stores the token). Every request is restricted to the faculties the dean is allowed to access; batches list only active batches (with enrolled students). All parameters are required unless noted otherwise.",
