          "response": [],
          "description": "Distinct lecturers assigned to courses within the dean's allowed faculties. No parameters required — automatically scoped to dean's faculties. OPTIONAL: facultyId (must be in dean's scope), departmentId to filter by department."
        },
        {
          "name": "Lecturer Courses (REQUIRED: lecturerId)",
